she has Int:10 now.  (Whoopee!)

Solutions:
 - Bless your spellbooks.
 - Gain levels ASAP.  Two XL are worth one Int.
 - Wear lenses, they're worth two Int.
 - Find and/or alchemize blessed !oGA (or blessed !oE).
 - Quaff from (magic) fountains.  Make sure your luck is at least 4.
 - Eat mind flayers.  (Implies gaining XL first -- or heading down --
   unless you revgeno them.)

...and finally, of course:

 - Don't read unblessed spellbooks yet, especially if they're high level.

As it happens, my healer knows fewer spells and casts them less often
than my valk did at the same stage in the game.  With her +3 GDSM
(from a spare magic lamp), she's also doing a lot more melee combat.
